WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.600
*Claire     * Flora
(Yearly Schedule/Plan)

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.600
*Claire     * Flora
(Yearly Schedule/Plan)

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:09.600
Your fate is in the stars,
so just take it!!

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:12.850
Seisho
 Festival

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:25.410
Okay...

00:00:37.950 --> 00:00:39.370
Position Zero!

00:00:40.830 --> 00:00:44.500
This concludes the first day of auditions.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:53.830
Karen Aijo... Your participation in
these auditions has been approved.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.330
H-huh? What?!

00:00:56.330 --> 00:01:02.450
May you all compete in song and dance,
each of you vying to become the next Top Star.

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:05.040
Wait a second. Where's Hikari-chan?

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:10.450
Please note that these auditions are strictly
confidential. You must not speak of them.

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.620
Should you mention this to anyone...

00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:14.040
...you will be fined.

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:14.750
Huh?!

00:01:15.290 --> 00:01:16.330
"Fined"?!

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:23.370
Karen-chan? What's wrong?

00:01:23.370 --> 00:01:26.870
Ah! No, I'm fine. I just had a weird dream.

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.620
Are you sure you're okay?

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.120
I'm fine, totally okay. No problem!

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.250
What on Earth even happened yesterday...?

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.790
H..Hikari-chan?

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.790
I shall be staying with you.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:56.330
What?!

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.850
Revue Starlight

00:02:20.290 --> 00:02:28.660
Ano hoshi o tsukamu no wa daare?
Who, oh who, will be the one to grab hold of the star?

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:35.620
Tou no choujou de
At the very top of that tower

00:02:36.950 --> 00:02:50.000
Shizuka ni tomotta honou ga atsuku mune o kogashite iku
These flames lit in silence fill my chest with a white-hot passion

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.250
Unmei no wa
That's just the Wheel of Fortune

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:59.910
Butai no ue de odorasareteiru wake ja nai
It's not like I'm being forced to dance on this stage

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:02.120
Tobitate
Spring forth

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:06.000
Tashika ni ano hi mitanda
I'm sure I saw it that day

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.660
Hajiketa hoshi no kirameki
The brilliance of a star that has burst open

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:16.120
Iroaseta yakusoku ni yubi ga fureru made
Until my fingers reach out to touch that faded promise

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.200
Makuake mae ni hajimaru
It will start before the curtain rises

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:23.750
Me no mae de tsuzurareteku
And be spelled out before our eyes

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:27.330
Umarekawatta watashi wa
Having been reborn

00:03:27.330 --> 00:03:31.160
Koko de kimi ni aeta
I was able to meet you here

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:34.580
Mou ichido
Once again

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.040
Hikari-chan!

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:47.330
Hikari-chan! Hikari-chan!

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.750
Wait! Tell me what's going on!

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.370
C'mon, Hikari-chan!

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:58.830
Together? She's going to be in OUR room, with us?

00:03:58.830 --> 00:04:03.330
Hikari-chan, what was all that?
I mean, a giraffe in a theater?!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.330
Didn't he tell you? We're forbidden to talk about it.

00:04:07.660 --> 00:04:09.290
Th-the fine!

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:11.580
Karen-chan?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:12.830
Huh? Oh...

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.290
Just talking to myself!

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:23.830
I never knew about that place.

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.950
There was a giraffe and a super weird stage...

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:31.370
And you two were really going at it.

00:04:34.160 --> 00:04:35.330
Move it!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.290
Hey. We're here, Kaoruko!

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:45.080
KAORUKO!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:49.370
Ah, jeez. I was having such a good dream...

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:52.450
How can you even sleep when you're sitting like that?

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:55.750
Your back makes me feel warm and safe, Futaba.

00:04:55.750 --> 00:04:57.200
C'mon. Let's go.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.830
Right, right.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:03.660
Motorcycles are okay at this school?

00:05:03.660 --> 00:05:04.830
Yup. They are.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:05.870
That's not the point!

00:05:05.870 --> 00:05:09.950
Kagura-san, I want some answers!
Why are you moving in with us?

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.370
Just yesterday you said that you couldn't do it!

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:15.250
I wondered if maybe I could.

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.410
Huh?!

00:05:17.160 --> 00:05:19.040
Ah! Hikari-chan, wait!

00:05:20.290 --> 00:05:21.660
No, no!

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.750
My vote is a huge "NO"!

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.410
Wh-what?

00:05:25.830 --> 00:05:29.160
Oh, my. They're already rehearsing -
and with PASSION, huh?

00:05:26.660 --> 00:05:28.450
No!

00:05:29.450 --> 00:05:35.160
I don't know what play this is, but that's a bold way
of putting that large frame of her to use!

00:05:35.160 --> 00:05:37.620
Agreed. I think it's great!

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:40.160
You guys have got it all wrong...

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.410
Oh, yeah! Hoshimi-san, yesterday was-

00:05:43.410 --> 00:05:45.250
Don't break the rules.

00:05:45.250 --> 00:05:46.040
Huh?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.160
Talking about it would definitely be seen as a violation.

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.700
You sure are popular, Karen-chan.

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:02.700
Okay, keep it steady!

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:08.950
But don't stop breathing.
Keep your stomach tight and breathe slowly.

00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:26.540
That's it.

00:06:31.200 --> 00:06:33.080
Good. Let's go higher.

00:06:39.160 --> 00:06:41.290
Okay, Aijo. Take it up a notch.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:51.120
Hikari-chan!

00:06:51.660 --> 00:06:53.870
You wanna have lunch together?

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:55.540
Huh?

00:06:56.080 --> 00:06:57.830
Hikari-chan!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:02.540
Maybe they don't eat lunch in England...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:08.250
We can't go in before the curtain rises, huh?

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:12.500
You can hear me, right? Look...

00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.830
Just drop Karen from the auditions.
She'll just get in the way.

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:20.290
I understand.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.290
I made a promise to Hikari-chan!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.750
I... No, we...

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:34.540
We WILL become stars, together!

00:07:35.080 --> 00:07:38.040
I see. So you've done it, yes?

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.160
Note: "BaKaren" is a combination of "baka" (idiot)
and "Karen" (her name)

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:43.200
Idiot... BaKaren!

00:07:45.120 --> 00:07:46.450
Found you.

00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:52.040
So this is where you've been, Hikari-chan.
I've been looking for you.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:56.540
Why?

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.830
Are you looking for something?

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:01.910
I just got lost. That's all.

00:08:02.410 --> 00:08:03.910
Oh. Well, okay!

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:10.000
Oh, yeah. I made some banana pudding.
You want to eat it with us?

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.830
I don't like things that wobble like that.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:18.330
Oh, my...

00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:33.950
Rumba Cross from a natural turn!

00:08:38.700 --> 00:08:42.330
You there! Don't look at your feet.
Are you keeping in step?!

00:08:42.330 --> 00:08:43.620
Y-yes!

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:44.580
I'm sorry.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:50.700
Hikari-chan... I couldn't even talk to you at lunch...

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.160
Wow! They really are amazing!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:09:00.500
Those two really do shine.

00:09:01.370 --> 00:09:04.200
There's Tendo, whose parents are stars of the stage...

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:08.370
And Claudine-chan, who's been
performing roles since she was a kid...

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.950
Top Star...

00:09:12.370 --> 00:09:15.870
Do I have... that "shine" inside me too?

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:23.790
Wow!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:25.410
That's Maya-sama for you!

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.580
So cool!

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.700
Perfect as always!

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:27.790
They're really great!

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.120
She paired up perfectly with Saijo-sama too.

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:29.500
It was wonderful!

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.790
They were both so cool!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.120
So wonderful...

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:34.660
If you're only here to watch, then get out.

00:09:36.700 --> 00:09:41.830
Get out. If you can't surpass these girls,
you'll never stand on center stage!

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:46.620
Hoshimi, that's enough.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.160
I'm sorry.

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:53.790
Okay, let's switch it up.
Pair up with whomever you like.

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.000
Ma'am!

00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:58.290
Nana?

00:09:58.290 --> 00:09:59.160
Hikari-chan!

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.040
Hikari-chan, wanna pair up?

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:02.250
Wha?!

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:14.620
Pair up with me!

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:15.580
What?

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:23.910
Um, Hoshimi-san... Uh... Um, um...

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:31.330
Can't you tell me anything about
that stage thing yesterday?

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:33.660
It was written in the text, right?

00:10:34.250 --> 00:10:35.200
Text?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:40.450
The revue for the chosen "Stage Girls."
Didn't you get the text?

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:42.700
What are you talking about?

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.450
So, you just gate-crashed?!

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.830
I crashed that gate!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:51.750
This isn't a joke! You should be kicked out!

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:55.540
Wow, they've got some mad skills.

00:10:55.540 --> 00:10:57.750
No, I think they're just mad...

00:10:58.040 --> 00:11:01.620
You weren't even selected,
so why are you getting in my way?!

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:06.700
This is serious for me! Unlike you, I...

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.250
That's enough.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.330
Hoshimi-san...

00:11:18.830 --> 00:11:20.660
Karen-chan, you did great!

00:11:23.870 --> 00:11:25.040
Junna-chan!

00:11:26.950 --> 00:11:28.000
Junna-chan!

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.040
Hoshimi-san!

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:30.370
Hoshimi!

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:32.790
Wake up, Hoshimi-san!

00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:36.910
Junna-chan...

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:40.830
Recently, she's been practicing on her own,
all morning and afternoon.

00:11:42.250 --> 00:11:44.700
I'll stay with her until she wakes up.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:47.080
Okay. Let us know when she does.

00:11:47.290 --> 00:11:48.700
Hoshimi-san...

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.450
Hey, Karen-chan. You should get back to class.

00:11:51.910 --> 00:11:53.950
Look after her, Banana.

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:55.160
You can count on me!

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:58.180
Actor Training
Department

00:11:58.370 --> 00:12:01.870
The most important thing is to have a broad perspective.

00:12:02.250 --> 00:12:07.370
The part that you yourself perform
is the smallest circle, here.

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:10.700
When you see the stage from
a more comprehensive point of view,

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:15.750
you can make your role that much
more appealing to the audience.

00:12:19.870 --> 00:12:22.250
Karen-chan, let's go... Huh?

00:12:28.540 --> 00:12:31.160
U-um... Hikari-chan?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.250
You've heard about the audition, right?

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:40.500
It's a revue for the chosen "Stage Girls."

00:12:40.750 --> 00:12:41.540
That's right.

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.500
So I want you to butt out, Karen.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:46.410
Huh?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.910
Are you awake?

00:13:01.540 --> 00:13:02.660
Oh...

00:13:06.370 --> 00:13:09.200
Did something happen between you and Karen-chan?

00:13:10.620 --> 00:13:13.790
Not really. She just got me a little angry.

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:17.510
Seisho Festival

00:13:17.510 --> 00:13:19.510
Seisho
All members of the 99th Class
Notice of the 100th Seisho Festival Auditions
99th Class 2nd Performance
The Drama "Starlight"

00:13:18.040 --> 00:13:18.790
Huh?

00:13:22.330 --> 00:13:24.620
So, is this about something else?

00:13:25.870 --> 00:13:28.580
It's all the same. To me, that is.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:33.620
You weren't chosen because
you don't have enough "shine."

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.700
People like you have no business
interfering with our auditions!

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.250
No!

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.700
I won't quit the auditions!

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:55.700
Because... what Hoshimi-san said
made my heart skip a beat!

00:13:58.250 --> 00:14:02.160
Even if I give it my all, I won't be able to catch up.

00:14:05.750 --> 00:14:08.910
No matter how hard I try, I can't make up the difference.

00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:12.620
But that's why I can't give up.

00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:15.120
Junna-chan...

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:19.700
"Starlight"
*Claire     * Flora

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:19.700
Your fate is in the stars,
so just take it!!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.410
I want to... become a star.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:24.410
If... and this is a big if...

00:14:24.910 --> 00:14:28.750
If you and I are gonna take the stage together
like we promised...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:32.200
but people like Tendo-san and
Claudine-chan get there first...

00:14:32.200 --> 00:14:32.790
Huh?

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:38.330
...then I'll have to surpass them,
just like Hoshimi-san said!

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.620
Otherwise, we'll never stand on stage together.

00:14:44.620 --> 00:14:45.580
Karen...

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:49.790
But... now I have a chance.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:51.290
Huh?

00:14:52.120 --> 00:14:56.290
Maybe I could stand on that stage
if I find my own "shine."

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:56.250
Seisho
All members of the 99th Class

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:56.250
Notice of the 100th Seisho Festival Auditions
99th Class 2nd Performance
The Drama "Starlight"

00:14:56.750 --> 00:15:00.370
Taking center stage, the spotlight focused on me...

00:15:01.620 --> 00:15:05.290
I might become a star!

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:13.660
Maybe my eyes have opened thanks
to you coming back...

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:22.950
Maybe it was to take that dream of
becoming stars together and make it real...

00:15:24.620 --> 00:15:28.040
Whatever it is, I want to do "Starlight" with you!

00:15:29.080 --> 00:15:30.250
Karen...

00:15:40.530 --> 00:15:45.030
Audition
Day 2

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:51.290
I AM                                      REBORN

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:52.580
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:52.960
No. 99 Trolley Furnace

00:15:58.880 --> 00:15:59.510
Sewing Process

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.810
Please do not touch

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.500
Atop a stage brimming with stardust,

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.700
the flowers of love have so magnificently bloomed...

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.120
Student of the 99th Class...

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.620
Karen Aijo!

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.700
We will ALL do Starlight!

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:34.620
Everyone has their own star of destiny.

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:37.750
Stars that shine, the morning star, stars that fall...

00:16:38.120 --> 00:16:42.620
Though I may not yet see my own star,
I gaze upward, and on this day...

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:46.120
I, Junna Hoshimi, student of the 99th Class...

00:16:46.910 --> 00:16:49.410
will take hold of a star of my own!

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.120
I thought that if I were beaten once,
it would all be over, but...

00:16:57.910 --> 00:17:02.040
Each Stage Girl is unique in her own way.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:06.450
These auditions are to find the Top Star among them.

00:17:08.870 --> 00:17:16.950
The Top Star is she who stands atop
the stage of fate brimming with limitless "shine."

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:22.410
It is the lead role, one with a brilliance
that transcends time and lasts for eternity.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:30.290
The "lead role"? If I become the Top Star,
I can become the lead in my own fate?

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.040
Hoshimi-san?

00:17:35.580 --> 00:17:38.370
This is my revenge match, Aijo-san.

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:47.660
Now then, this second day of auditions
shall be "A Revue of Desire."

00:17:48.450 --> 00:17:55.410
May you all compete in song and dance,
each of you vying to become the next Top Star.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:56.160
Revue of Desire

00:18:01.660 --> 00:18:06.750
Why did this happen?

00:18:06.750 --> 00:18:15.080
I've been enveloped in flames, imprisoned by them

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:15.250
G-glasses?

00:18:15.080 --> 00:18:17.830
For so very long

00:18:15.660 --> 00:18:20.540
I'll do it, just you watch...
I WILL take the lead and become a star!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:24.250
Now, those flames will never burn out

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:31.750
Because I've had no one who understands

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:37.200
To be by my side

00:18:35.370 --> 00:18:36.330
She's gone?!

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:42.830
I've been buffeted by gales of wind, my heart aflame

00:18:37.200 --> 00:18:38.330
Hoshimi-san?

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:48.790
Only that star knows what I seek

00:18:51.640 --> 00:18:56.640
Junna Hoshimi
Age 8

00:18:53.250 --> 00:18:56.450
All I've ever done is study....

00:18:57.500 --> 00:19:00.410
But for the first time, I've found a dream
that shines so brightly!

00:19:01.500 --> 00:19:04.290
Not to be important, not to be clever...

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:10.830
And I found it purely by chance - a star that's just for me.
Somehow, we found each other!

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:16.080
On that day, I was reborn. I became a Stage Girl!

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:20.870
But...

00:19:22.500 --> 00:19:26.620
no matter how hard I tried, I could never reach them...

00:19:28.290 --> 00:19:32.290
Those people who are always running forward...

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:35.750
Is the future unattainable?

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:40.950
Surely, no one can know that

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:46.450
I continued fighting with a shadow of myself

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:52.580
Only that star knows what it is that I seek

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:53.290
If it means I can become a star, then I...!

00:19:52.580 --> 00:20:00.580
When the curtain rises, the future is sure to come for me

00:19:58.160 --> 00:19:59.200
A mannequin?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:06.580
Yes, I can't be here, so I'll go much farther away

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:09.580
Here, I cannot lose

00:20:08.000 --> 00:20:08.870
Another one?

00:20:09.290 --> 00:20:11.540
I refuse to stay hidden in the shadows!

00:20:09.580 --> 00:20:10.660
There is no loss

00:20:10.660 --> 00:20:11.830
I can't make a mistake

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:13.790
I will catch up to you and then I'll show you all!

00:20:11.830 --> 00:20:13.120
It's not a mistake

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:16.950
You don't understand

00:20:14.250 --> 00:20:19.000
And I don't understand you, which is why

00:20:19.000 --> 00:20:22.000
We can talk to each other

00:20:22.000 --> 00:20:22.950
The darkness of night

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:24.250
Until morning comes

00:20:24.250 --> 00:20:25.660
Grows deeper

00:20:25.660 --> 00:20:30.330
There is a future for everyone

00:20:27.120 --> 00:20:31.830
I can't just stay hidden, and so

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:31.200
I won't lose! I CAN'T lose!

00:20:31.830 --> 00:20:33.620
All on my own

00:20:32.910 --> 00:20:35.040
I'll catch up to you all, just you watch!

00:20:33.620 --> 00:20:36.790
A dream I was on the verge of forgetting, ah

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.700
You can't do much of anything

00:20:37.700 --> 00:20:38.580
And yet

00:20:38.580 --> 00:20:41.200
Even I

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.160
Can't stand to lose

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.160
I want to make good on that promise

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.750
These auditions are my chance...

00:20:50.250 --> 00:20:52.910
It's a chance I can't pass up.

00:20:53.700 --> 00:20:55.580
There's no way I could pass it up!

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:58.290
I will grab hold of my very own star.

00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.540
I won't let my performance be cut short.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:04.000
It's settled!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.790
That's a big non, non!

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:11.330
It doesn't end after one shot!

00:21:11.910 --> 00:21:14.750
We can take the stage over and over again.

00:21:15.410 --> 00:21:17.500
Passion and "shine."

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.450
Yes, I understand.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:23.120
That is the power of the Stage Girl.

00:21:23.500 --> 00:21:27.120
I won't give up! I am a Stage Girl!

00:21:27.750 --> 00:21:31.080
I want to be a star!

00:21:27.870 --> 00:21:33.370
One, just one

00:21:31.660 --> 00:21:36.290
Hikari-chan and I are going to be stars, together!

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:38.950
For the sake of just one promise

00:21:38.950 --> 00:21:44.120
If only that star knows the future

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:51.500
I'll look up at the sky and gently reach out my hand

00:21:59.040 --> 00:22:00.410
Position Zero!

00:22:01.200 --> 00:22:04.790
This concludes the second day of auditions.

00:22:07.950 --> 00:22:15.660
I understand now... why she was not initially chosen.

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:19.750
Two people sharing a single fate...

00:22:22.910 --> 00:22:24.750
I'm sorry, Karen.

00:22:29.080 --> 00:22:31.870
A dream shared by two...

00:22:39.500 --> 00:22:42.080
I lost again.

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:48.580
You did great.

00:22:51.500 --> 00:22:54.040
Maybe I'm overthinking things.

00:22:54.040 --> 00:22:54.870
Huh?

00:22:54.870 --> 00:22:57.830
I mean, it's like the simple-minded ones
are the more powerful.

00:22:57.830 --> 00:23:01.000
Hey! It's rude to call me that!

00:23:02.120 --> 00:23:04.120
Hup.

00:23:06.000 --> 00:23:08.040
But this isn't the end, right?

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:10.540
So, I'm going to see this through to the end.

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:13.620
We have to give our all and reach for the stars...

00:23:17.120 --> 00:23:17.870
Right?

00:23:19.910 --> 00:23:21.120
Hoshimi-san!

00:23:22.540 --> 00:23:24.870
You can just... call me "Junna."

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:27.450
Got it, Jun-jun!

00:23:27.450 --> 00:23:28.620
That was sudden...

00:23:29.120 --> 00:23:30.700
And feel free to call me "Karen"!

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:33.330
Oh, yeah. Someone called you BaKaren earlier, right?

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:36.000
Jun-jun, come on!

00:23:46.500 --> 00:23:50.620
A dream is not something one has...
it's something that enchants.

00:23:50.950 --> 00:23:54.160
Only one shall obtain that glittering star...

00:23:56.330 --> 00:23:58.120
This is Tendo Maya.

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:04.410
Next Time
Top Star

00:24:00.200 --> 00:24:02.580
Revue Starlight.

00:24:02.910 --> 00:24:04.040
I understand.
